  "verbatim_context": [
    "The engineering risk (vmap-safe NL stacking across genuinely different bundles) is fully proven by my synthetic 2-bundle test — that risk is identical regardless of whether the bundles happen to be the same protein or different ones.",
    "What remains unverified locally is purely a performance question (actual compile-time reuse for real solvated systems), which needs either the cluster or a longer local run."
